lass=\"region region-content\">\n    <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n<div id=\"block-globalabc-content\" class=\"block block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"basic-page-banner\">\n  <div class=\"basic-page-no-image\">\n    <img src=\"/sites/default/files/2020-03/banner%204_4.jpg\"/>\n  </div>\n\n      <div class=\"breadcrumb breadcrumb2\">\n      <div class=\"container container2\">\n        <div class=\"block-system-breadcrumb-block\">  <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"system-breadcrumb\">\n    <h2 id=\"system-breadcrumb\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Breadcrumb</h2>\n    <ol>\n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n                  Steel Reuse: Incorporating reclaimed steel at Holbein Gardens\n              </li>\n        </ol>\n  </nav>\n</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"basic-page-title\">\n      <div class=\"container container2\">\n        <h2>Resources</h2>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"resource-item-wrapper-full\">\n    <div class=\"resource-item-topblock-full\">\n      <div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n        <div class=\"resource-item-image-full\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2023-09/cleveland%20steel.jpg\" width=\"642\" height=\"424\" alt=\"Steel Reuse: Incorporating reclaimed steel at Holbein Gardens\" />\n\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-sm-9\">\n        <div class=\"resource-item-rightblock-full\">\n          <div class=\"resource-item-title-full\">\n            Steel Reuse: Incorporating reclaimed steel at Holbein Gardens\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"resource-item-date\">\n            2023-09-06\n          </div>\n                      <div class=\"resource-type\">\n              <span>Type:\n              </span>\n                                              <a href=\"/sustainable-materials-hub/resources/case-study\" hreflang=\"en\">Case study</a>\n                          </div>\n                                                              <div class=\"resource-material\">\n              <span>Material:\n              </span>\n                                              <a href=\"/susteinable-materials-hub/resources/steel\" hreflang=\"en\">Steel</a>\n                          </div>\n                                <div class=\"resource-policy\">\n              <span>Policy challenge:\n              </span>\n                                              <a href=\"/susteinable-materials-hub/resources/circularity\" hreflang=\"en\">Circularity</a>\n                          </div>\n                                <div class=\"solution\">\n              <span>Solutions:\n              </span>\n                                              <a href=\"/taxonomy/term/131\" hreflang=\"en\">Avoid</a>\n                                                <span class=\"comma-symbol\" style=\"margin-left: -5px;font-weight: normal;\">,\n                  </span>\n                                <a href=\"/taxonomy/term/132\" hreflang=\"en\">Improve</a>\n                          </div>\n                  </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"resource-item-summary field-body\">\n      <p>The UK Government’s recent climate change legislation and the ambitious carbon targets from funders and end users, are encouraging developers and their design teams to look at exactly where carbon is contained within construction projects and where it can be reduced.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Effective re-use of steel offers significant reductions in carbon emissions compared to specifying new steel.&nbsp; This case study from Heyne Tillett Steel profiles a project at Holbein Gardens in London, in which they partnered with Cleveland Steel, a specialist steel stockist dealing in reclaimed steel.&nbsp; This partnership, which repurposed steel from existing sites as well as using&nbsp;Cleveland Steel's stock, enabled 35% of Holbein Gardens' steel to come from re-used sources.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"resource-item-filegroup\">\n      \n                  \n\n            \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"resource-item-external-link\">\n      <div class=\"box-files col-aux\">\n        \n            <div><a href=\"https://hts.uk.com/blog/reuse-of-steel/\">Steel Reuse: Incorporating reclaimed steel at Holbein Gardens</a></div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n          </section>\n        </div>\n                <!-- End Content -->\n\n        <!-- Sidebar Second -->\n                <!-- End Sidebar Second -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <!-- End Main Content Region -->\n\n\n  <!-- Bottom Content Region -->\n    <!-- End Bottom Content Region -->\n\n  <!-- Bottom Region -->\n    <!-- End Bottom Region -->\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            \n            \n                        <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"bottom-menus-block-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"bottom-social\">\n                      <div class=\"bottom-logos-text\">\n                          <a href=\"/\" class=\"logo-footer\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/globalabc/images/Global-ABC-Logo-White.svg\"/></a>\n                          <a href=\"https://www.unep.org/\" class=\"logo-footer-2\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/globalabc/images/logo-unep-2019-white.svg\"/></a>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-calendar\">\n                        <div class=\"views-element-container\"><div class=\"js-view-dom-id-d75559d55e0b2886ba386dd5f307c2a65dbcc0d630f576df05cca7f869c34cbd\">\n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"calendar-calendar\">\n  <div class=\"title-date\">June 2026</div>\n  