data-mwl-img-id=\"519\" /></figure><div class=\"link\">Read more</div>\n</a></div><div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<a href=\"https://circularmaterialsystems.com/en/case/01_en_bombasei-areal/\" class=\"content-item\"><h3>Bombasei Areal</h3>\n<span>Nanikon, Switzerland </span><figure class=\"m-block single-thumbnail\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMDAiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAxNTAwIDEwMDAiPjxyZWN0IHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIHN0eWxlPSJmaWxsOiNjZmQ0ZGI7ZmlsbC1vcGFjaXR5OiAwLjE7Ii8+PC9zdmc+\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1000\" data-src=\"https://circularmaterialsystems.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/01_Banner_GH.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-478 wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" data-srcset=\"https://circularmaterialsystems.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/01_Banner_GH.jpg 1500w, https://circularmaterialsystems.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/01_Banner_GH-300x200.jpg 300w, https://circularmaterialsystems.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/01_Banner_GH-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://circularmaterialsystems.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/01_Banner_GH-768x512.jpg 768w, https://circularmaterialsystems.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/01_Banner_GH-18x12.jpg 18w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px\" data-mwl-img-id=\"478\" /></figure><div class=\"link\">Read more</div>\n</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></main></div></div><footer id=\"colophon\" class=\"site-footer\" role=\"contentinfo\"><div class=\"container\"><div><b>Circular Material Systems</b><br>2023</div><nav class=\"footer-navigation\"><div class=\"footer-menu-container\"><ul class=\"footer-navigation-wrapper\"><li id=\"menu-item-1016\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1016\"><a href=\"https://circularmaterialsystems.com/en/imprint/\">Imprint</a></li><li id=\"menu-item-1014\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu