61.825 66.979Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M85.797 87.532H44.317C43.7032 87.5315 43.1148 87.2872 42.681 86.8529C42.2473 86.4186 42.0038 85.8298 42.004 85.216V43.748C42.004 43.1346 42.2477 42.5462 42.6815 42.1125C43.1153 41.6787 43.7036 41.435 44.317 41.435H85.797C86.4105 41.435 86.9988 41.6787 87.4326 42.1125C87.8663 42.5462 88.11 43.1346 88.11 43.748V85.217C88.1103 85.8308 87.8668 86.4196 87.433 86.8539C86.9993 87.2882 86.4108 87.5315 85.797 87.532ZM46.63 82.904H83.485V46.064H46.63V82.904Z\" />\n    </g>\n\n    <g class=\"plus\">\n        <path d=\"M70.31 11.328H65.885V34.763H70.31V11.328Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M79.815 20.833H56.38V25.258H79.815V20.833Z\" />\n    </g>\n</svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"menu-overlay__plus-content\">\n                    <p>\n                        <span>HTS+</span> is our self-funded research initiative.\n                    </p>\n                    \n                    <button class=\"button\" tabindex=\"-2\">\n                        <span class=\"button__text\">\n                            Learn more\n                        </span>\n\n                        <span class=\"button__icon\">\n                            <svg class=\"svg-fill\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M9.44827 2.01321L7.98173 3.47975L11.8524 7.35045L1.04289 7.39217L1.03299 9.46824L11.8454 9.47177L7.96334 13.3538L9.44827 14.8387L15.861 8.42596L9.44827 2.01321Z\"/>\n</svg>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<main class=\"site-wrapper behind-header\">    <section class=\"hero-split grid-outer js-hero-split\">\n        <div class=\"hero-split__media-wrap\">        <video \n            class=\"hero-split__media\" \n            preload=\"none\"\n                            muted=\"\"\n                autoplay=\"\"\n                                        loop\n                                                    poster=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_2024_Wales_IMG_7036.jpg?fit=1600%2C1200&ssl=1\" \n                        playsinline\n                            src=\"https://hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Culture_02_LR.mp4\"\n                                        width=\"1680\"\n                                        height=\"944\"\n                    ></video>       \n    </div>\n        <h1 class=\"hero-split__title grid-inner\">\n            <div class=\"hero-split__mask hero-split__mask--left js-mask\"><span class=\"left js-left\">Enjoy</span></div><div class=\"hero-split__mask hero-split__mask--right js-mask\"><span class=\"right js-right\">Engineering</span></div>        </h1>\n\n            </section>\n    <section class=\"culture-intro ttm background-lemon color-slate headings-ochre\">\n                    <div class=\"ttm__content grid-outer\">\n                <div class=\"ttm__title grid-inner js-load-in\">\n                    <h2 class=\"char-animate js-load-in js-char-animate\">Our practice</h2>                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"ttm__text grid-inner js-load-in\">\n                    <div class=\"rich-text flow-medium\"><p>We&#8217;re a dynamic practice of over 180 staff with offices in London and Manchester, working with the UK’s leading developers and architects.</p>\n<p>Our proactive approach, dedicated innovation studio <a href=\"http://hts.uk.com/research-innovation/\">HTS+</a>, and culture of continuous learning means we never stop pushing the boundaries of not only what’s possible, but the best thing to do.</p>\n</div>                        <a class=\"button\" href=\"https://hts.uk.com/careers/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"button__text\">\n                                Careers at HTS                            </span>\n\n                            <span class=\"button__icon\">\n                                <svg class=\"svg-fill\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M9.44827 2.01321L7.98173 3.47975L11.8524 7.35045L1.04289 7.39217L1.03299 9.46824L11.8454 9.47177L7.96334 13.3538L9.44827 14.8387L15.861 8.42596L9.44827 2.01321Z\"/>\n</svg>\n                            </span>\n                        </a>\n                                    </div>\n            </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"ttm__cards js-load-in\">\n                                        <div class=\"ttm__card\">\n                            <div class=\"ttm__card-media-wrap\">        <video \n            class=\"ttm__card-media js-lazy\" \n            preload=\"none\"\n                            muted=\"\"\n                autoplay=\"\"\n                                        loop\n                                                    poster=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_2024_HTS-Studio-117.jpg?fit=1600%2C1067&ssl=1\" \n                        playsinline\n                            data-src=\"https://hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/office_5sec-web_01_LR.mp4\"\n                                        width=\"1920\"\n                                        height=\"1080\"\n                    ></video>       \n    </div>\n                                                            <a class=\"ttm__media-button button\" href=\"http://hts.uk.com/people/?studio=london\" target=\"\">\n                                    <span class=\"button__text\">\n                                        Meet the London team                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"button__icon\">\n                                        <svg class=\"svg-fill\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M9.44827 2.01321L7.98173 3.47975L11.8524 7.35045L1.04289 7.39217L1.03299 9.46824L11.8454 9.47177L7.96334 13.3538L9.44827 14.8387L15.861 8.42596L9.44827 2.01321Z\"/>\n</svg>\n                                    </span>\n                                </a>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                            <div class=\"ttm__card\">\n                                    \n        <picture \n            class=\"ttm__card-media-wrap \"\n                    >\n                            <source \n                    type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                    srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DSC3203.jpg?w=1277&amp;ssl=1 1277w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DSC3203.jpg?resize=600%2C399&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DSC3203.jpg?resize=1024%2C682&amp;ssl=1 1024w\"\n                    sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 100vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 100vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n                        \n            <source \n                type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DSC3203.jpg?w=1277&amp;ssl=1 1277w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DSC3203.jpg?resize=600%2C399&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DSC3203.jpg?resize=1024%2C682&amp;ssl=1 1024w\"\n                sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 100vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 100vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n            \n            <img\n                src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DSC3203.jpg?fit=600%2C399&#038;ssl=1\"\n                width=\"1277\"\n                height=\"850\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                class=\"ttm__card-media\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                \n                                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                    fetchpriority=\"auto\"\n                \n                                />\n\n        </picture>\n    \n                                                            <a class=\"ttm__media-button button\" href=\"http://hts.uk.com/people/?studio=manchester\" target=\"\">\n                                    <span class=\"button__text\">\n                                        Meet the Manchester team                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"button__icon\">\n                                        <svg class=\"svg-fill\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M9.44827 2.01321L7.98173 3.47975L11.8524 7.35045L1.04289 7.39217L1.03299 9.46824L11.8454 9.47177L7.96334 13.3538L9.44827 14.8387L15.861 8.42596L9.44827 2.01321Z\"/>\n</svg>\n                                    </span>\n                                </a>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n            </section>\n\n<section class=\"culture-values grid-outer js-values background-lemon color-slate headings-ochre\">\n    <div class=\"culture-values__content grid-inner\">\n                    <h2 class=\"char-animate js-load-in js-char-animate\">\n                Our culture            </h2>\n        \n                    <nav class=\"culture-values__nav js-values-nav\">\n                <a href=\"#communityandsocialvalue\" class=\"js-scroll-to js-scroll-target active\" data-scroll-offset=\"30\" data-scroll-target=\"communityandsocialvalue\">Community and social value</a><a href=\"#equalitydiversityandinclusion\" class=\"js-scroll-to js-scroll-target\" data-scroll-offset=\"30\" data-scroll-target=\"equalitydiversityandinclusion\">Equality, diversity and inclusion</a><a href=\"#employeeownershiptrust\" class=\"js-scroll-to js-scroll-target\" data-scroll-offset=\"30\" data-scroll-target=\"employeeownershiptrust\">Employee ownership trust</a><a href=\"#sustainablepractices\" class=\"js-scroll-to js-scroll-target\" data-scroll-offset=\"30\" data-scroll-target=\"sustainablepractices\">Sustainable practices</a><a href=\"#bcorpcertified\" class=\"js-scroll-to js-scroll-target\" data-scroll-offset=\"30\" data-scroll-target=\"bcorpcertified\">B Corp certified</a>            </nav>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"culture-values__items grid-inner\">\n                            <div id=\"communityandsocialvalue\" class=\"culture-values__item js-scroll-section\">\n                            \n        <picture \n            class=\"culture-values__media-wrap \"\n                    >\n                            <source \n                    type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                    srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?w=2500&amp;ssl=1 2500w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?resize=600%2C458&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?resize=1024%2C782&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?resize=1600%2C1222&amp;ssl=1 1600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?resize=2048%2C1564&amp;ssl=1 2048w\"\n                    sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 60vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 60vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n                        \n            <source \n                type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?w=2500&amp;ssl=1 2500w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?resize=600%2C458&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?resize=1024%2C782&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?resize=1600%2C1222&amp;ssl=1 1600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?resize=2048%2C1564&amp;ssl=1 2048w\"\n                sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 60vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 60vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n            \n            <img\n                src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1638_04_cJackHobhouse_200916_01-1.jpg?fit=600%2C458&#038;ssl=1\"\n                width=\"2048\"\n                height=\"1564\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                class=\"culture-values__media\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                \n                                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                    fetchpriority=\"auto\"\n                \n                                />\n\n        </picture>\n    \n                                            <h3>\n                            Community and social value                        </h3>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"rich-text flow-medium\">\n                        <p>We’re committed to making a positive impact on society and the environment and using our resources to better the lives of others.</p>\n<p>We work with local schools and colleges, offering talks and mentoring to help engage more students in STEM subjects, as well as partnering on social mobility programmes with organisations like Firm Foundations and Beyond the Box.</p>\n<p>We have a programme of undertaking community and charitable projects, which have included: <a href=\"http://hts.uk.com/project/steel-warriors/\">Steel Warriors</a>, <a href=\"http://hts.uk.com/project/brixton-windmill/\">Brixton Windmill</a>, <a href=\"http://hts.uk.com/project/herne-hill-velodrome/\">Herne Hill Velodrome</a> and <a href=\"http://hts.uk.com/project/horatios-garden/\">Horatio’s Garden</a>.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div id=\"equalitydiversityandinclusion\" class=\"culture-values__item js-scroll-section\">\n                            \n        <picture \n            class=\"culture-values__media-wrap \"\n                    >\n                            <source \n                    type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                    srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?w=2560&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?resize=600%2C400&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?resize=1600%2C1067&amp;ssl=1 1600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?resize=2048%2C1366&amp;ssl=1 2048w\"\n                    sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 60vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 60vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n                        \n            <source \n                type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?w=2560&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?resize=600%2C400&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?resize=1600%2C1067&amp;ssl=1 1600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?resize=2048%2C1366&amp;ssl=1 2048w\"\n                sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 60vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 60vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n            \n            <img\n                src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-98.jpg?fit=600%2C400&#038;ssl=1\"\n                width=\"2048\"\n                height=\"1366\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                class=\"culture-values__media\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                \n                                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                    fetchpriority=\"auto\"\n                \n                                />\n\n        </picture>\n    \n                                            <h3>\n                            Equality, diversity and inclusion                        </h3>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"rich-text flow-medium\">\n                        <p>Our practice is run in an ethical and fair way, with employees, colleagues and clients treated honestly and fairly.</p>\n<p>We offer programs to support different routes into the industry including mentorship, apprenticeships and internships for individuals from underrepresented groups.</p>\n<p>Our internal Diversity &amp; Inclusion group organises training and events throughout the year, as well as conducting an annual EDI survey to ensure we’re continuing to create the conditions in which everyone can do their best.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div id=\"employeeownershiptrust\" class=\"culture-values__item js-scroll-section\">\n                            \n        <picture \n            class=\"culture-values__media-wrap \"\n                    >\n                            <source \n                    type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                    srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2024_Wales_image00001.jpg?w=1939&amp;ssl=1 1939w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2024_Wales_image00001.jpg?resize=600%2C410&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2024_Wales_image00001.jpg?resize=1024%2C700&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2024_Wales_image00001.jpg?resize=1600%2C1093&amp;ssl=1 1600w\"\n                    sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 60vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 60vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n                        \n            <source \n                type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2024_Wales_image00001.jpg?w=1939&amp;ssl=1 1939w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2024_Wales_image00001.jpg?resize=600%2C410&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2024_Wales_image00001.jpg?resize=1024%2C700&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2024_Wales_image00001.jpg?resize=1600%2C1093&amp;ssl=1 1600w\"\n                sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 60vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 60vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n            \n            <img\n                src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2024_Wales_image00001.jpg?fit=600%2C410&#038;ssl=1\"\n                width=\"1939\"\n                height=\"1325\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                class=\"culture-values__media\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                \n                                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                    fetchpriority=\"auto\"\n                \n                                />\n\n        </picture>\n    \n                                            <h3>\n                            Employee ownership trust                        </h3>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"rich-text flow-medium\">\n                        <p>Heyne Tillett Steel has been an Employee Ownership Trust (EOT) since April 2021. The move reflects the core values of the practice and acknowledges the commitment and investment of our people to its success.</p>\n<p>Alongside the Directors, a Trust Board oversees the strategic direction of the practice and an Employee Council, made up of staff from all levels and disciplines, enables employees to have a more active role in the direction of the practice.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div id=\"sustainablepractices\" class=\"culture-values__item js-scroll-section\">\n                    <div class=\"culture-values__media-wrap\">        <video \n            class=\"culture-values__media js-lazy\" \n            preload=\"none\"\n                            muted=\"\"\n                autoplay=\"\"\n                                        loop\n                                                    poster=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/HTS-Studio-87-e1739906613326.jpg?fit=1280%2C870&ssl=1\" \n                        playsinline\n                            data-src=\"https://hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/practice_lunch_02_LR.mp4\"\n                                        width=\"1920\"\n                                        height=\"1080\"\n                    ></video>       \n    </div>\n                                            <h3>\n                            Sustainable practices                        </h3>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"rich-text flow-medium\">\n                        <p>We strive to minimise our environmental footprint in our practice as well as through our designs. We enjoy daily cooked vegetarian lunches, prepared with locally sourced ingredients where possible, encourage active travel through cycling schemes and use 100% renewable energy to power our London office.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div id=\"bcorpcertified\" class=\"culture-values__item js-scroll-section\">\n                    <div class=\"culture-values__media-wrap\">        <video \n            class=\"culture-values__media js-lazy\" \n            preload=\"none\"\n                            muted=\"\"\n                autoplay=\"\"\n                                        loop\n                                                    poster=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/n0005_BCorp-e1759144532990.jpg?fit=827%2C664&ssl=1\" \n                        playsinline\n                            data-src=\"https://hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/BCorp_4_LR.mp4\"\n                                        width=\"1920\"\n                                        height=\"1080\"\n                    ></video>       \n    </div>\n                                            <h3>\n                            B Corp certified                        </h3>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"rich-text flow-medium\">\n                        <p>HTS became a certified B Corporation in 2023 , joining a global community of businesses that meet high standards of social and environmental performance, accountability and transparency. Being B Corp certified means that we&#8217;re legally committed to considering the interests of all stakeholders in our business operations: employees, customers, communities and the environment. In short; to using our business as a force for good.</p>\n<p>Read our 2024 Impact Report <a href=\"https://hts.uk.com/news-views/our-2024-impact-report/\">here</a>.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"culture-content ttm js-content background-lemon color-slate headings-ochre\">\n                    <div class=\"ttm__content grid-outer\">\n                <div class=\"ttm__title grid-inner js-load-in\">\n                    <h2 class=\"char-animate js-load-in js-char-animate\">Continuous learning</h2>                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"ttm__text grid-inner js-load-in\">\n                    <div class=\"rich-text flow-medium\"><p>Bringing fresh ideas and innovation to every project relies on continuous learning and knowledge-sharing.</p>\n<p>Internally, we host technical lunch sessions twice a week as well as bimonthly assemblies on emerging issues. Focus groups meet regularly and act as knowledge centres and sounding boards on specialist subjects.</p>\n<p>We also offer external CPD sessions and take an active role in industrywide initiatives like the Engineers Reuse Collective, UKGBC, LETI and Structural and Civil Engineers Declare.</p>\n</div>                        <a class=\"button\" href=\"http://hts.uk.com/news-views/\" target=\"\">\n                            <span class=\"button__text\">\n                                News & Views                            </span>\n\n                            <span class=\"button__icon\">\n                                <svg class=\"svg-fill\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M9.44827 2.01321L7.98173 3.47975L11.8524 7.35045L1.04289 7.39217L1.03299 9.46824L11.8454 9.47177L7.96334 13.3538L9.44827 14.8387L15.861 8.42596L9.44827 2.01321Z\"/>\n</svg>\n                            </span>\n                        </a>\n                                    </div>\n            </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"ttm__cards js-load-in\">\n                                        <div class=\"ttm__card\">\n                                    \n        <picture \n            class=\"ttm__card-media-wrap \"\n                    >\n                            <source \n                    type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                    srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-94.jpg?w=2560&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-94.jpg?resize=600%2C400&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Culture_HTS-Studio-94.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploa