p is back, with croissant and cheese making, Eiffel tower tours and haunted pastry walks in the 2025 HTS trip to Paris.</p>\n            </div>\n        \n            </div>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://hts.uk.com/news-views/hts-adventures-in-snowdonia-2024/\" class=\"card card--news js-load-in\">\n            \n        <picture \n            class=\"card__media-wrap \"\n                    >\n                            <source \n                    type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                    srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?resize=450%2C600&amp;ssl=1 450w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?resize=768%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?resize=1200%2C1600&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?resize=1536%2C2048&amp;ssl=1 1536w\"\n                    sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 60vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 60vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n                        \n            <source \n                type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?resize=450%2C600&amp;ssl=1 450w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?resize=768%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?resize=1200%2C1600&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?resize=1536%2C2048&amp;ssl=1 1536w\"\n                sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 60vw,\n              (min-width: 601px) 60vw,\n              (max-width: 600px) 100vw\">\n            \n            <img\n                src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/n0014_Wales2024_12.jpg?fit=450%2C600&#038;ssl=1\"\n                width=\"1536\"\n                height=\"2048\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                class=\"card__media\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                \n                                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                    fetchpriority=\"auto\"\n                \n                                />\n\n        </picture>\n    \n    <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    <small>\n                Adventure, Practice            </small>\n        \n        <h3>\n            From summit to sea: adventures in Snowdonia        </h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"rich-text flow-small\">\n                <p>Our London and Manchester teams came together in North Wales to take on hiking, gorge scrambling, mountain biking and more on our annual trip.</p>\n            </div>\n        \n            </div>\n</a>\n            </div>\n            </section>\n    <section class=\"signpost grid-outer background-ochre color-stone headings-lemon\">\n                    <h2 class=\"grid-inner char-animate js-load-in js-char-animate\">\n                Careers at HTS            </h2>\n        \n\n                \n        <picture \n            class=\"signpost__media-wrapper grid-inner \"\n                    >\n                            <source \n                    type=\"image/jpeg\"\n                    srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/careers_1418_01-2.jpg?w=2560&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/careers_1418_01-2.jpg?resize=600%2C400&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/careers_1418_01-2.jpg?resize=1024%2C682&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/careers_1418_01-2.jpg?resize=1600%2C1066&amp;ssl=1 1600w, https://i0.wp.com/hts.uk.com/